{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1621814400, "end_date": 1622505599, "month_true_total": 62, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:48:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "92950799", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058938853", "personaname": "Panda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198058938853/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 3257, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 530, "last_played": 1734773347, "avatar": "b900f2d8482c74ae9661962b5a735f1402ce98be"}, "language": "english", "review": "yo this ♥♥♥♥ 's fire.", "timestamp_created": 1622487691, "timestamp_updated": 1622487721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92939994", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004468758", "personaname": "Elyrien Valkyr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ElyrienValkyr/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 305, "playtime_forever": 859, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 87, "last_played": 1722999127, "avatar": "66235464222399aa27c6499e5f0fe14c88bf3139"}, "language": "english", "review": "Only took a handful of runs to see this game was definitely well made. First time I've seen an early access game without bugs, glitches, or any kind of problems. Maybe they're there, but I wouldn't know. Everything was so smooth that it actually threw me off. Though there were definitely things you could do that I wasn't expecting. Like sliding and mario jumping on enemy heads. \n\nBeing a stealth bot and just playing leap frog across 20 enemies isn't something you expect in an fps... but I'm gonna keep doing it.\n\nI assume the Early Access tag explains the low weapon and enemy variety, but it's not all that bad. Definitely looking forward to seeing what the full release will have added.", "timestamp_created": 1622475760, "timestamp_updated": 1622475760, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92894113", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035859479", "personaname": "sad sack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/blackmeatonmanstreet/", "num_games_owned": 925, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 1500, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 706, "last_played": 1700457044, "avatar": "485ed982308162cf06a5e46f5925e249c25d1a62"}, "language": "english", "review": "simply epic", "timestamp_created": 1622407635, "timestamp_updated": 1622407635, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92840171", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014549116", "personaname": "Poopman Actual", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GigaTerry/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 5035, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 641, "last_played": 1742678851, "avatar": "24003c313b0851fc683564916585bedece7494c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great movement, aesthetic, weapons and co-op experience. Would like to hear more varied music too. I can't wait to see what's added to this game through development.", "timestamp_created": 1622345545, "timestamp_updated": 1622345545, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92824983", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027199558", "personaname": "AjisaiVT", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027199558/", "num_games_owned": 1261, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 2246, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "last_played": 1700237459, "avatar": "a2c496f8c8fe3b33176d634aed2a08aa8d89d535"}, "language": "english", "review": "[strike]Another lovely rogue-like with a lot of promise. I can feel the inspiration from Dead Cells on much of its mechanics. especially the stat system. The tight controls and many play styles make it something I know I'll come back to. Especially with more content and balancing coming down the line.[/strike]\n\nComing back to this game later down the line, with the stat system reworked from the dead cell style to a more exp focused trait and weapon system, I still have to say that I adore this game, and constantly come back to it to try out new content. I love that the game is constantly improving and finding more ways to beat me back down. I don't always feel like a badass, and thats perfectly alright with me. I like the challenge when it provides me equal reward!\n\nPS: the Robo is a total Himbo and [i]that is [b]STILL[/b] doing it for me[/i].", "timestamp_created": 1622323616, "timestamp_updated": 1665028937, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}